---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CTABanner from '../components/CTABanner.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Trosk Dubai Group | Partner Profile | Vrosk Energies"
  description="Discover Trosk, the Dubai-based investment group with over $200M in diversified portfolios and the founding sponsor of Vrosk Energies."
  currentPath="/trosk"
>
  <!-- Header -->
  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 60px; padding-bottom: 50px; background: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(22,21,21,0.06);">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="max-width: 840px;">
        <div class="badge-pill mint">
          <span class="badge-dot"></span>
          <span>Global Sponsor & Investor</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="heading-1" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
          Trosk Dubai Group
        </h1>
        <p class="body-lead">
          A Dubai-based registered conglomerate holding a robust investment portfolio valued at well over $200M USD across oil & gas, physical commodities, finance, and manufacturing in West Africa and global markets.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Profile Content -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="bento-hero-grid">
        <div class="bento-card" style="background: #ffffff; padding: 44px; justify-content: space-between;">
          <div>
            <div class="mono-tag" style="color: #0b4026; margin-bottom: 14px;">PARENT FOUNDATION</div>
            <h2 class="heading-2" style="font-size: 1.85rem; margin-bottom: 20px;">
              Over $200M USD Portfolio Backing Direct West African Energy Assets
            </h2>

            <p class="body-regular" style="margin-bottom: 18px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7;">
              Trosk is a Dubai-based registered international business with a diversified investment portfolio operating across key market areas in West Africa and worldwide. With strategic holdings spanning physical commodities, financial technologies, industrial manufacturing, and energy infrastructure, Trosk operates as a patient, strategic capital allocator.
            </p>

            <blockquote style="background: var(--bg-color); border-left: 4px solid #0d7543; padding: 20px 24px; border-radius: 0 var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0; margin: 24px 0; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--neutral-04);">
              "In fact, the birth of Vrosk was as a result of Trosk's appetite to not only maintain third-party investments in the Oil & Gas sector, but to become an active, hands-on participant with direct equity investments and operational infrastructure in the West African energy space."
            </blockquote>

            <p class="body-regular" style="margin-bottom: 18px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.7;">
              Through this sponsorship, Vrosk Energies benefits from international credit standing, direct relationships with global trading houses in Geneva, London, Singapore, and Dubai, and the balance-sheet backing needed to execute high-volume physical cargo transactions.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(22,21,21,0.08); margin-top: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px;">
            <div style="font-size: 0.8125rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--neutral-03);">
              DOMICILE: DUBAI, UNITED ARAB EMIRATES
            </div>
            <a href="/our-company-overview" class="btn btn-secondary" style="font-size: 0.875rem;">
              Read Our Corporate Story →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Sidebar Bento Cards -->
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px;">
          <div class="bento-card-dark" style="background: var(--dark-surface-01);">
            <div class="mono-tag" style="color: var(--theme-color-01); margin-bottom: 12px;">GLOBAL PORTFOLIO</div>
            <div class="stat-number" style="font-size: 2.75rem; margin-bottom: 8px;">
              $200M+
            </div>
            <div class="stat-label" style="color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 12px;">Direct & Indirect Valuation</div>
            <p style="color: #a8a4a4; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;">
              Concentrated in high-growth African infrastructure, manufacturing, and commodity trade flows.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bento-card" style="background: #ffffff;">
            <div class="mono-tag" style="color: #0b4026; margin-bottom: 12px;">FOUNDING OBJECTIVE</div>
            <h3 class="heading-3" style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 8px;">Direct Energy Execution</h3>
            <p class="body-small" style="line-height: 1.6;">
              Created to build physical asset resilience, owned terminal tanks, and clean gas virtual pipelines across Nigeria and neighboring West African states.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTABanner />
</BaseLayout>
